AIPLAY H3 control preprocessors

This package contains a small source subset of Fannovel16/comfyui_controlnet_aux,
revision 59b1fc411ede8623b2997855b8018f0b3b6cf49f (Apache License 2.0).
The original source filenames, SHA-256 hashes and local adaptations are recorded
in SOURCES.json. The full Apache License is included as LICENSE.

Depth Anything V2 architecture:
  https://github.com/DepthAnything/Depth-Anything-V2
  Includes DINOv2 code, copyright Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
  Original DINOv2 copyright notices have been retained in each applicable file.
  Related original references to DINO and timm remain in the copied sources.

TorchScript YOLOX and DWPose preprocessing/inference:
  Source subset from comfyui_controlnet_aux, using the OpenMMLab-style affine
  transforms and SimCC decoding shipped in its TorchScript implementation.
  https://github.com/IDEA-Research/DWPose
  https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX

AIPLAY adaptations: flattened local imports, a simple sequential transform in
place of torchvision Compose, Comfy-selected model device, corrected padding
for fixed batches, strict offline model lookup and a new OpenCV-only renderer.
No CMU/OpenPose body, hand, face or drawing implementation is included.
No downloader, ONNX backend, matplotlib or scikit-image dependency is included.

The original-format full-width H3 control loader implements the inverse layout
mapping documented by the VideoX-Fun publisher at commit
9dc6f1d49ab14b35ec956c13ac9e35d6d52c527d:
https://github.com/aigc-apps/VideoX-Fun/blob/9dc6f1d49ab14b35ec956c13ac9e35d6d52c527d/videox_fun/models/minimax_h3_conversion.py#L439-L473
It concatenates Q, K and V in that order and swaps the feed-forward value/gate
row halves to match native SwiGLU. It does not approximate a timestep basis or
rewrite a checkpoint. This loader is specific to the original 74-tensor v1 file.

This notice covers source code only. Estimator weights are separately obtained
through the Studio catalogue and retain their own terms and uncertainty notices.
Depth Anything V2 Small is selected explicitly; the non-commercial Large model
is not accepted by these nodes. No inference or accuracy benchmark is implied
by bundling this source.
